# Shared build context. Patterns match from the context root, including nested copies.
# .env.example is the only env file that may be copied.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/var
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.nx
**/.git
apps/web-e2e
**/screenshots
**/*screenshot*
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/*.log
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
# Regenerated by `prisma generate` in the image. Gitignored, and omitted so the context stays small.
packages/db/src/generated
**/.angular
